DTSTART:20261030T143000Z
DTEND:20261030T151500Z
SUMMARY:Guided Grounds Tour
DESCRIPTION:In person · Free · This is a free guided walk of the Sagamore
  Hill grounds.\n\nStep back in time with the Roosevelts and hear stories a
 bout their lives at Sagamore Hill. This will be a 30-45 minute guided walk
  around the grounds of Sagamore Hill. The tour will begin at the picnic ar
 ea\, with stops…\n\nListed by National Park Service (Roosevelt sites)\n\
 nhttps://www.nps.gov/planyourvisit/event-details.htm?id=1F4824F4-F75A-F0BA
 -50FE72A58E97BABC
LOCATION:Sagamore Hill National Historic Site\, Meet at the picnic area by 
 the parking lot.\, Oyster Bay\, NY
URL:https://www.nps.gov/planyourvisit/event-details.htm?id=1F4824F4-F75A-F0
 BA-50FE72A58E97BABC
CATEGORIES:National Park Service (Roosevelt sites),In person,Free,Tour
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
