DTSTART:20261030T170000Z
DTEND:20261030T174500Z
SUMMARY:TR's Birthday Celebration Performance
DESCRIPTION:In person · Free\n\nJoe Wiegand\, the fantastic Theodore Roose
 velt re-enactor\, is celebrating TR's 168th birthday with two special perf
 ormances at Theodore Roosevelt Birthplace National Historic Site. The perf
 ormances will be held at 1:00…\n\nListed by National Park Service (Roose
 velt sites)\n\nhttps://teddyrooseveltshow.com
LOCATION:Theodore Roosevelt Birthplace National Historic Site\, 28 East 20t
 h Street\, New York\, NY 10003\, New York\, NY
URL:https://teddyrooseveltshow.com
CATEGORIES:National Park Service (Roosevelt sites),In person,Free,Event
STATUS:CONFIRMED
